<h1>Screenshot Cleaner - Privacy Policy</h1>

<p class="updated">
    Last updated: October 2, 2026
</p>

<div class="box">
    <strong>Privacy summary:</strong>
    Screenshot Cleaner processes screenshots locally on your device.
    Your photos and screenshots are not uploaded to our servers.
</div>

<h2>1. About Screenshot Cleaner</h2>

<p>
    Screenshot Cleaner is an Android application designed to help users
    find, review, select, and remove screenshots stored on their device.
</p>

<h2>2. Photo and Media Access</h2>

<p>
    Screenshot Cleaner may request permission to access images stored on
    your device. This access is required for the application's core
    functionality: locating screenshots, displaying them to the user,
    calculating their storage usage, filtering older screenshots, and
    allowing the user to select screenshots for removal.
</p>

<p>
    Screenshot Cleaner only uses this access to provide these
    device-cleaning and screenshot-management features.
</p>

<h2>3. Local Processing</h2>

<p>
    Screenshot analysis and management are performed locally on your
    device.
</p>

<p>
    Screenshot Cleaner does not upload your photos or screenshots to a
    remote server or cloud service.
</p>

<h2>4. Deleting Screenshots</h2>

<p>
    Screenshot Cleaner does not automatically delete your screenshots.
    The user chooses which screenshots to remove.
</p>

<p>
    Where required by Android, the operating system displays a deletion
    confirmation before the selected images are removed.
</p>

<h2>5. Personal Data</h2>

<p>
    Screenshot Cleaner does not require users to create an account or
    sign in.
</p>

<p>
    The application does not intentionally collect names, email
    addresses, phone numbers, account credentials, or other personal
    identification information.
</p>

<h2>6. Advertising and Analytics</h2>

<p>
    Screenshot Cleaner does not contain advertising SDKs and does not
    use third-party advertising services.
</p>

<p>
    The application does not use third-party analytics services to track
    user activity.
</p>

<h2>7. Data Sharing</h2>

<p>
    Screenshot Cleaner does not sell or share users' photos,
    screenshots, or personal information with third parties.
</p>

<h2>8. Data Storage</h2>

<p>
    Screenshot Cleaner does not maintain an external database containing
    users' screenshots or personal information.
</p>

<p>
    Images accessed by the application remain on the user's device unless
    the user chooses to delete them.
</p>

<h2>9. Children's Privacy</h2>

<p>
    Screenshot Cleaner does not knowingly collect personal information
    from children.
</p>

<h2>10. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>

<p>
    This Privacy Policy may be updated if the application's features or
    privacy practices change. Any updated version will be published on
    this page.
</p>

<h2>11. Contact</h2>

<p>
    If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, you can contact the
    developer using the contact information provided on the application's
    Google Play Store listing.
</p>

